sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Respondent
    participant P as Survey page
    participant F as better-fetch
    participant A as Hono API
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    participant S as S3 bucket

    U->>P: Open /f/formId
    P->>F: GET /forms/:id
    F->>A: request
    A->>D: load form + questions
    D-->>A: rows
    A-->>P: form (validated response)
    P->>P: buildAnswerSchema(questions)

    opt File question
        P->>A: POST /uploads/presign (name, type, size)
        A-->>P: presigned URL + key
        P->>S: PUT file directly
        S-->>P: 200 OK
    end

    U->>P: Submit answers
    P->>P: zodResolver validates (client)
    P->>F: POST /forms/:id/submissions
    F->>A: request
    A->>D: load questions
    A->>A: buildAnswerSchema + validate (server)
    alt Invalid
        A-->>P: 400 VALIDATION_ERROR + issues
    else Valid
        A->>D: transaction: Submission + Answers
        D-->>A: ok
        A-->>P: 201 Created
    end
